    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"015H","type":"translation","data":"God, God, the Lord God is the rain drop and I, a sparrow hawk, am wailing and bewailing for it.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"015H","type":"translation","data":"ਵਾਹਿਗੁਰੂ, ਵਾਹਿਗੁਰੂ, ਸੁਆਮੀ ਵਾਹਿਗੁਰੂ ਮੀਂਹ ਦੀ ਇਕ ਕਣੀ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਮੈਂ ਪਪੀਹਾ ਉਸ ਲਈ ਵਿਲਕ ਤੇ ਵਿਰਲਾਪ ਕਰ ਰਿਹਾ ਹਾਂ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"015H","type":"translation","data":"The Lord, Har, Har, is the rain-drop; I am the song-bird, crying, crying out for it.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"015H","type":"translation","data":"ਹੇ ਹਰੀ! ਹੇ ਸੁਆਮੀ! ਮੈਂ ਪਪੀਹਾ ਤੇਰੇ ਨਾਮ-ਬੂੰਦ ਵਾਸਤੇ ਤੜਫ਼ ਰਿਹਾ ਹਾਂ। (ਮੇਹਰ ਕਰ), ਤੇਰਾ ਨਾਮ ਮੇਰੇ ਵਾਸਤੇ (ਸ੍ਵਾਂਤੀ-) ਬੂੰਦ ਬਣ ਜਾਏ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"1UR6","type":"translation","data":"To die and to live, God has given us the earth; but so many favours of His, we have forgotten.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"1UR6","type":"translation","data":"ਮਰਨ ਅਤੇ ਜੀਊਣ ਲਈ, ਵਾਹਿਗੁਰੂ ਨੇ ਸਾਨੂੰ ਧਰਤੀ ਦਿਤੀ ਹੈ, ਪ੍ਰੰਤੂ ਉਸ ਦੇ ਐਨੇ ਉਪਕਾਰ ਅਸੀਂ ਭੁਲਾ ਦਿੱਤੇ ਹਨ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"1UR6","type":"translation","data":"To die and to live, He gave us the earth, but we have forgotten these blessings. ||2||","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"1UR6","type":"translation","data":"ਵੱਸਣ ਵਾਸਤੇ (ਜੀਵਾਂ ਨੂੰ) ਧਰਤੀ ਦਿੱਤੀ ਹੈ (ਜੀਵਾਂ ਨੇ ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਭੁਲਾ ਕੇ ਉਸ ਦੇ) ਇਤਨੇ ਉਪਕਾਰ ਵਿਸਾਰ ਦਿੱਤੇ ਹਨ ॥੨॥","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"1WUN","type":"translation","data":"There are good many adepts, strivers, yogis, wandering saints, spiritual guides and good men.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"1WUN","type":"translation","data":"ਅਨੇਕਾਂ ਹੀ ਕਰਾਮਾਤੀ ਬੰਦੇ ਅਭਿਆਸੀ, ਯੋਗੀ, ਰਮਤੇ ਸਾਧੂ, ਰੂਹਾਨੀ ਰਹਿਬਰ ਅਤੇ ਨੇਕ ਬੰਦੇ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"1WUN","type":"translation","data":"There are so many Siddhas, seekers, Yogis, wandering pilgrims, spiritual teachers and good people.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"1WUN","type":"translation","data":"ਜਗਤ ਵਿਚ ਅਨੇਕਾਂ ਜੰਗਮ ਜੋਗੀ ਪੀਰ ਜੋਗ-ਸਾਧਨਾਂ ਵਿਚ ਪੁੱਗੇ ਹੋਏ ਜੋਗੀ ਅਤੇ ਹੋਰ ਸਾਧਨ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ ਵੇਖਣ ਵਿਚ ਆਉਂਦੇ ਹਨ,","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"3X7E","type":"translation","data":"He alone is Gorakh, who is sustaining the world, and who made no delay in fashioning it. Pause.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"3X7E","type":"translation","data":"ਕੇਵਲ ਉਹ ਹੀ ਗੋਰਖ ਹੈ ਜੋ ਸ਼੍ਰਿਸ਼ਟੀ ਨੂੰ ਸਹਾਰਾ ਦੇ ਰਿਹਾ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਜਿਸ ਨੇ ਇਸ ਨੂੰ ਸਾਜਦਿਆਂ ਚਿਰ ਨਹੀਂ ਲਾਇਆ। ਠਹਿਰਾਓ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"3X7E","type":"translation","data":"He alone is Gorakh, who sustains the earth; He created it in an instant. ||1||Pause||","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"3X7E","type":"translation","data":"(ਮੇਰਾ) ਗੋਰਖ ਉਹ ਹੈ ਜਿਸ ਨੇ ਸ੍ਰਿਸ਼ਟੀ ਪੈਦਾ ਕੀਤੀ ਹੈ, ਤੇ ਪੈਦਾ ਕਰਦਿਆਂ ਚਿਰ ਨਹੀਂ ਲੱਗਦਾ ॥੧॥ ਰਹਾਉ ॥","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"4X9N","type":"translation","data":"O father! God, the Protector of the Universe, ever remains wakeful.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"4X9N","type":"translation","data":"ਹੇ ਪਿਤਾ! ਸੰਸਾਰ ਦਾ ਰੱਖਿਅਕ, ਵਾਹਿਗੁਰੂ ਸਦਾ ਹੀ ਜਾਗਦਾ ਰਹਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"4X9N","type":"translation","data":"O Baba, Gorakh is the Lord of the Universe; He is always awake and aware.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"4X9N","type":"translation","data":"ਹੇ ਜੋਗੀ! (ਮੈਂ ਭੀ ਗੋਰਖ ਦਾ ਚੇਲਾ ਹਾਂ, ਪਰ ਮੇਰਾ) ਗੋਰਖ (ਸਦਾ ਜੀਊਂਦਾ) ਜਾਗਦਾ ਹੈ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"6S9L","type":"translation","data":"What can death do unto them, O slave Nanak, who meet with such saints?","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"6S9L","type":"translation","data":"ਜੋ ਐਹੋ ਜਿਹੇ ਸਾਧੂਆਂ ਦੀ ਸੰਗਤ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ, ਹੇ ਦਾਸ ਨਾਨਕ! ਮੌਤ ਉਹਨਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਕੁਝ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰ ਸਕਦੀ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"6S9L","type":"translation","data":"Those who meet with such devotees, O servant Nanak - what can death do to them? ||4||4||","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"6S9L","type":"translation","data":"ਇਸੇ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ, ਹੇ ਦਾਸ ਨਾਨਕ! ਭਗਤ ਜਨ ਪਰਮਾਤਮਾ ਦੇ ਚਰਨਾਂ ਵਿਚ ਮਿਲੇ ਰਹਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ, ਜਮ ਉਹਨਾਂ ਦਾ ਕੁਝ ਵਿਗਾੜ ਨਹੀਂ ਸਕਦਾ ॥੪॥੪॥","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"7W4Q","type":"translation","data":"The Lord's meditation and the Guru's instruction, is the music of my horn, which the people hear.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"7W4Q","type":"translation","data":"ਸੁਆਮੀ ਦਾ ਸਿਮਰਨ ਅਤੇ ਗੁਰਾਂ ਦਾ ਉਪਦੇਸ਼ ਮੇਰੀ ਤੁਰੀ ਦੀ ਸੁਰੀਲੀ ਸੁਰ ਹੈ, ਜਿਸ ਨੂੰ ਲੁਕਾਈ ਸੁਣਦੀ ਹੈ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"7W4Q","type":"translation","data":"Awareness of the Shabad and the Teachings is my horn; the people hear the sound of its vibrations.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"7W4Q","type":"translation","data":"(ਜੋ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ ਸਾਰੇ) ਜਗਤ ਨੂੰ ਸੁਣਦਾ ਹੈ (ਭਾਵ, ਸਾਰੇ ਜਗਤ ਦੀ ਸਦਾਅ ਸੁਣਦਾ ਹੈ) ਉਸ ਦੇ ਚਰਨਾਂ ਵਿਚ ਸੁਰਤ ਜੋੜਨੀ ਮੇਰੀ ਸਦਾਅ ਹੈ, ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਆਪਣੇ ਅੰਦਰ ਸਾਖਿਆਤ ਵੇਖਣਾ (ਉਸ ਦੇ ਦਰ ਤੇ) ਮੇਰੀ ਸਿੰਙੀ ਵੱਜ ਰਹੀ ਹੈ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"8T6Y","type":"translation","data":"As an opium-addict dies without opium, so perish I without the Lord. Pause.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"8T6Y","type":"translation","data":"ਜਿਸ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਅਫੀਮ ਖਾਣ ਦਾ ਆਦੀ, ਅਫੀਮ ਦੇ ਬਗੈਰ ਮਰ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ, ਓਸੇ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਹੀ ਮੈਂ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ ਦੇ ਬਾਝੋਂ ਮਰ ਮੁਕ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹਾਂ। ਠਹਿਰਾਓ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"8T6Y","type":"translation","data":"Like the addict who dies without his drug, I die without the Lord. ||Pause||","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"8T6Y","type":"translation","data":"ਜਿਵੇਂ (ਅਫ਼ੀਮ ਆਦਿਕ) ਨਸ਼ੇ ਤੋਂ ਬਿਨਾ ਅਮਲੀ (ਨਸ਼ੇ ਦਾ ਆਦੀ) ਮਨੁੱਖ ਤੜਫ਼ ਉੱਠਦਾ ਹੈ, ਤਿਵੇਂ ਪਰਮਾਤਮਾ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਤੋਂ ਬਿਨਾ ਮੈਂ ਘਬਰਾ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹਾਂ ਰਹਾਉ॥","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"AS0C","type":"translation","data":"If I meet them, then shall I utter the Lord's praise and then alone will my mind serve Him.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"AS0C","type":"translation","data":"ਜੇਕਰ ਮੈਂ ਉਹਨਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਮਿਲ ਪਵਾਂ, ਛਾਂ ਮੈਂ ਸਾਈਂ ਦੀ ਸਿਫ਼ਤ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰਾਂਗਾ ਤੇ ਤਦ ਹੀ ਮੇਰਾ ਚਿੱਤ ਉਸ ਦੀ ਘਾਲ ਕਮਾਏਗਾ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"AS0C","type":"translation","data":"If I meet them, I chant the Lord's Praises, and then, my mind serves Him. ||3||","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"AS0C","type":"translation","data":"ਪਰ ਮੈਂ ਤਾਂ ਜੇ ਉਹਨਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਮਿਲਾਂਗਾ ਤਾਂ (ਉਹਨਾਂ ਨਾਲ ਮਿਲ ਕੇ) ਪਰਮਾਤਮਾ ਦੀ ਸਿਫ਼ਤਿ-ਸਾਲਾਹ ਹੀ ਕਰਾਂਗਾ (ਮੇਰਾ ਜੀਵਨ-ਨਿਸ਼ਾਨਾ ਇਹੀ ਹੈ) ਮੇਰਾ ਮਨ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ ਦਾ ਸਿਮਰਨ ਹੀ ਕਰੇਗਾ ॥੩॥","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"DA32","type":"translation","data":"Binding together water, air etc. the Lord has placed life in the body and made the great lamps of the moon and the sun.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"DA32","type":"translation","data":"ਜਲ, ਹਵਾ ਆਦਿਕ ਨੂੰ ਬੰਨ੍ਹ ਕੇ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ ਨੇ ਦੇਹ ਅੰਦਰ ਜਿੰਦ ਜਾਨ ਟਿਕਾ ਦਿੱਤੀ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਚੰਨ ਤੇ ਸੂਰਜ ਦੇ ਦੀਵੇ ਬਣਾਏ ਹਨ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"DA32","type":"translation","data":"Binding together water and air, He infused the breath of life into the body, and made the lamps of the sun and the moon.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"DA32","type":"translation","data":"(ਜਿਸ ਪਰਮਾਤਮਾ ਨੇ) ਪਾਣੀ ਪਉਣ (ਆਦਿਕ ਤੱਤਾਂ) ਵਿਚ (ਜੀਵਾਂ ਦੇ) ਪ੍ਰਾਣ ਟਿਕਾ ਕੇ ਰੱਖ ਦਿੱਤੇ ਹਨ, ਸੂਰਜ ਤੇ ਚੰਦ੍ਰਮਾ ਮੁਖੀ ਦੀਵੇ ਬਣਾਏ ਹਨ,","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"E34W","type":"translation","data":"God's saints and slaves meditate on God, and are imbued with the deep crimson colour of the Guru.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"E34W","type":"translation","data":"ਵਾਹਿਗੁਰੂ ਦੇ ਸਾਧੂ ਅਤੇ ਸੇਵਕ ਵਾਹਿਗੁਰੂ ਦਾ ਸਿਮਰਨ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਗੁਰਾਂ ਦੀ ਗੂੜ੍ਹੀ ਲਾਲ ਰੰਗਤ ਨਾਲ ਰੰਗੀਜੇ ਹੋਏ ਹਨ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"E34W","type":"translation","data":"The Lord's humble Saints meditate on the Lord; they are imbued with the deep crimson color of the Guru's Love.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"E34W","type":"translation","data":"ਹੇ ਭਾਈ! ਪਰਮਾਤਮਾ ਦੇ ਜਿਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਸੰਤ ਜਨਾਂ ਨੇ ਪਰਮਾਤਮਾ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਜਪਿਆ, ਉਹ ਗੁਰੂ ਦੇ (ਬਖ਼ਸ਼ੇ ਹੋਏ) ਗੂੜ੍ਹੇ ਪ੍ਰੇਮ-ਰੰਗ ਵਿਚ ਰੰਗੇ ਗਏ,","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"HU0Q","type":"translation","data":"Pepper and salt remain safe and sound in clarified butter, and the lotus remain safe and sound in clarified butter, and the lotus remains unaffected in water.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"HU0Q","type":"translation","data":"ਕਾਗਜ਼ ਤੇ ਲੂਣ, ਘਿਓ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਹੀ ਸਲਾਮਤ ਰਹਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਕੰਵਲ ਫੁਲ ਜਲ ਅੰਦਰ ਨਿਰਲੇਪ ਵਿਚਰਦਾ ਹੈ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"HU0Q","type":"translation","data":"Paper and salt, protected by ghee, remain untouched by water, as the lotus remains unaffected in water.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"HU0Q","type":"translation","data":"ਜਿਵੇਂ ਲੂਣ ਘਿਉ ਵਿਚ ਪਿਆ ਗਲਦਾ ਨਹੀਂ, ਜਿਵੇਂ ਕਾਗ਼ਜ਼ ਘਿਉ ਵਿਚ ਰੱਖਿਆ ਗਲਦਾ ਨਹੀਂ, ਜਿਵੇਂ ਕੌਲ ਫੁੱਲ ਪਾਣੀ ਵਿਚ ਰਿਹਾਂ ਕੁਮਲਾਂਦਾ ਨਹੀਂ,","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"J066","type":"translation","data":"O Lord, God, my Master, shower Thy benediction and pour into my mouth Thy Name drop, even for a moment.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"J066","type":"translation","data":"ਹੇ ਵਾਹਿਗੁਰੂ ਸੁਆਮੀ! ਮੇਰੇ ਮਾਲਕ! ਤੂੰ ਆਪਣੀ ਮਿਹਰ ਧਾਰ, ਤੇ ਇਕ ਮੁਹਤ ਲਈ ਮੇਰੇ ਮੂੰਹ ਵਿੱਚ ਆਪਣੇ ਨਾਮ ਦੀ ਕਣੀ ਪਾ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"J066","type":"translation","data":"O Lord God, please bless me with Your Mercy, and pour Your Name into my mouth, even if for only an instant. ||1||","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"J066","type":"translation","data":"ਹੇ ਹਰੀ! ਹੇ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ! ਆਪਣੀ ਮੇਹਰ ਕਰ, ਅੱਖ ਦੇ ਝਮਕਣ ਜਿਤਨੇ ਸਮੇ ਵਾਸਤੇ ਹੀ ਮੇਰੇ ਮੂੰਹ ਵਿਚ (ਆਪਣੀ ਨਾਮ ਦੀ ਸ੍ਵਾਂਤੀ) ਬੂੰਦ ਪਾ ਦੇ ॥੧॥","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"LHMA","type":"translation","data":"Thou, O Lord, are the remotest of the remote and the most excellent of the excellent. Thine extent and state, Thou alone knowest.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"LHMA","type":"translation","data":"ਤੂੰ ਹੇ ਠਾਕਰ ਪਰੇਡੇ ਤੋਂ ਪਰਮ ਪਰੇਡੇ ਅਤੇ ਉੱਤਮਾਂ ਚੋਂ ਪਰਮ ਉੱਤਮ ਹੈਂ। ਆਪਣਾ ਵਿਸਥਾਰ ਤੇ ਅਵਸਥਾ, ਕੇਵਲ ਤੂੰ ਹੀ ਜਾਣਦਾ ਹੈਂ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"LHMA","type":"translation","data":"You are the most remote of the remote, limitless and transcendent; O Lord Master, You alone know Your state and extent. ||2||","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"LHMA","type":"translation","data":"ਤੂੰ ਪਰੇ ਤੋਂ ਪਰੇ ਹੈਂ, ਤੂੰ ਬੇਅੰਤ ਹੈਂ। ਹੇ ਸੁਆਮੀ! ਤੂੰ ਕਿਹੋ ਜਿਹਾ ਹੈਂ ਤੇ ਕਿਤਨਾ ਵੱਡਾ ਹੈਂ-ਇਹ ਭੇਤ ਤੂੰ ਆਪ ਹੀ ਜਾਣਦਾ ਹੈਂ ॥੨॥","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"NEFV","type":"translation","data":"Slave Nanak has entered Thine sanctuary, O Lord Now, preserve Thou, the honour of Thy saint.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"NEFV","type":"translation","data":"ਦਾਸ ਨਾਨਕ ਨੇ ਤੇਰੀ ਸ਼ਰਣਾਗਤ ਸੰਭਾਲੀ ਹੈ, ਹੇ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ! ਹੁਣ ਤੂੰ ਆਪਣੇ ਸੇਵਕ ਦੀ ਇਜ਼ਤ ਆਬਰੂ ਨੂੰ ਬਰਕਰਾਰ ਰੱਖ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"NEFV","type":"translation","data":"Servant Nanak has come to Your Sanctuary, O Lord; protect and preserve the honor of Your devotee. ||4||5||","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"NEFV","type":"translation","data":"ਹੇ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ! ਤੇਰਾ ਦਾਸ ਨਾਨਕ ਤੇਰੀ ਸਰਨ ਆਇਆ ਹੈ। ਤੂੰ ਆਪ ਹੀ ਆਪਣੇ ਭਗਤਾਂ ਦੀ ਇੱਜ਼ਤ ਰੱਖਦਾ ਹੈਂ ॥੪॥੫॥","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"Q1E7","type":"translation","data":"Thou, O God, art an exceedingly deep ocean and I can find not even a trace of Thine limits.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"Q1E7","type":"translation","data":"ਤੂੰ ਹੇ ਵਾਹਿਗੁਰੂ! ਅਤਿਅੰਤ ਡੂੰਘਾ ਸਮੁੰਦਰ ਹੈਂ। ਮੈਂ ਤੇਰੇ ਓੜਕ ਨੂੰ ਇੱਕ ਭੋਰਾ ਭੀ ਨਹੀਂ ਲੱਭ ਸਕਦਾ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"Q1E7","type":"translation","data":"You, Lord, are the deepest, most unfathomable ocean; I cannot find even a trace of Your limits.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"Q1E7","type":"translation","data":"ਹੇ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ! ਤੂੰ (ਗੁਣਾਂ ਦਾ) ਬੜਾ ਹੀ ਡੂੰਘਾ ਸਮੁੰਦਰ ਹੈਂ, ਅਸੀਂ ਤੇਰੀ ਡੂੰਘਾਈ ਦਾ ਅੰਤ ਰਤਾ ਭਰ ਭੀ ਨਹੀਂ ਲੱਭ ਸਕਦੇ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"T35Q","type":"translation","data":"Without God, I can live not even for a second.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"T35Q","type":"translation","data":"ਹਰੀ ਦੇ ਬਗੈਰ ਮੈਂ ਇੱਕ ਛਿਨ ਭਰ ਭੀ ਰਹਿ ਨਹੀਂ ਸਕਦਾ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"T35Q","type":"translation","data":"Without the Lord, I cannot live for even a second.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"T35Q","type":"translation","data":"ਹੇ ਭਾਈ! ਪਰਮਾਤਮਾ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਤੋਂ ਬਿਨਾ ਮੈਂ ਰਤਾ ਭਰ ਸਮੇ ਲਈ ਭੀ ਰਹਿ ਨਹੀਂ ਸਕਦਾ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"TGW2","type":"translation","data":"Dhanasri 4th Guru.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"TGW2","type":"translation","data":"ਧਨਾਸਰੀ ਚੌਥੀ ਪਾਤਸ਼ਾਹੀ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"TGW2","type":"translation","data":"Dhanaasaree, Fourth Mehl:","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"TP8R","type":"translation","data":"Ramkali 1st Guru.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"TP8R","type":"translation","data":"ਰਾਮਕਲੀ ਪਹਿਲੀ ਪਾਤਿਸ਼ਾਹੀ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"TP8R","type":"translation","data":"Raamkalee, First Mehl:","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"UY9H","type":"translation","data":"God Himself is the Master and Himself the servant. He Himself creates the atmosphere for his service.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"UY9H","type":"translation","data":"ਵਾਹਿਗੁਰੂ ਆਪ ਮਾਲਕ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਆਪ ਹੀ ਦਾਸ ਉਹ ਆਪੇ ਹੀ ਆਪਣੀ ਸੇਵਾ ਦਾ ਵਾਯੂ ਮੰਡਲ ਰਚ ਦਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"UY9H","type":"translation","data":"He Himself is the Lord and Master, and He Himself is the servant; He Himself creates His environments.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"UY9H","type":"translation","data":"ਪਰ, ਹੇ ਭਾਈ! ਭਗਤੀ ਕਰਨ ਦੀ ਵਿਓਂਤ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ ਆਪ ਹੀ ਬਣਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ (ਢੋ ਆਪ ਹੀ ਢੁਕਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ), ਉਹ ਆਪ ਹੀ ਮਾਲਕ ਹੈ ਆਪ ਹੀ ਸੇਵਕ ਹੈ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"XE92","type":"translation","data":"Honour is my bowl for begging, and I long to have the alms of the Lord's Name.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"XE92","type":"translation","data":"ਇਜ਼ਤ ਆਬਰੂ ਮੇਰਾ ਮੰਗਣ ਲਈ ਖੱਪਰ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਦੀ ਖੈਰ ਲੈਣ ਦੀ ਚਾਹਣਾ ਹੈ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"XE92","type":"translation","data":"Honor is my begging-bowl, and the Naam, the Name of the Lord, is the charity I receive. ||1||","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"XE92","type":"translation","data":"(ਉਸ ਦਰ ਤੋਂ ਭਿੱਛਿਆ) ਮੰਗਣ ਲਈ ਆਪਣੇ ਆਪ ਨੂੰ ਯੋਗ ਪਾਤ੍ਰ ਬਣਾਣਾ ਮੈਂ (ਮੋਢੇ ਉਤੇ) ਝੋਲੀ ਪਾਈ ਹੋਈ ਹੈ, ਤਾ ਕਿ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਨਾਮ-ਭਿੱਛਿਆ ਮਿਲ ਜਾਏ ॥੧॥","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"ZHAQ","type":"translation","data":"Great is the glory of the Lord God's devotee and contemplating on the Master he attains sublime honour.","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":2},
    {"asset_id":"SBMS","line_id":"ZHAQ","type":"translation","data":"ਪਰਮ ਪ੍ਰਭਤਾ ਹੋ ਜਾਂਦੀ ਹੈ ਸੁਆਮੀ ਵਾਹਿਗੁਰੂ ਦੇ ਅਨੁਰਾਗੀ ਦੀ। ਮਾਲਕ ਦਾ ਚਿੰਤਨ ਕਰਨ ਦੁਆਰਾ ਉਹ ਸ੍ਰੇਸ਼ਟ ਇਜ਼ਤ ਆਬਰੂ ਨੂੰ ਪ੍ਰਾਪਤ ਹੋ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ।","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":3},
    {"asset_id":"DSSK","line_id":"ZHAQ","type":"translation","data":"Meditating on the Lord, they attain great glory, and the most sublime honor. ||3||","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"en\"}","priority":4},
    {"asset_id":"PSST","line_id":"ZHAQ","type":"translation","data":"ਉਹਨਾਂ ਦੇ ਅੰਦਰ ਪਰਮਾਤਮਾ ਦੀ ਭਗਤੀ ਦਾ ਰੰਗ ਬਣ ਗਿਆ, ਉਹਨਾਂ ਨੂੰ (ਲੋਕ ਪਰਲੋਕ ਵਿਚ) ਬੜੀ ਸੋਭਾ ਮਿਲੀ। ਜਿਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਨੇ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਜਪਿਆ, ਉਹਨਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਉੱਤਮ ਇੱਜ਼ਤ ਪ੍ਰਾਪਤ ਹੋਈ ॥੩॥","additional":"{\"type\":\"translation\",\"language\":\"pa\"}","priority":6}
  ]
